  "exemplar": {
    "messages": [
      {
        "content": "You operate business apps by calling tools. Reply with exactly ONE JSON object and nothing else.\n\nAllowed replies:\n{\"tool\":\"api_search\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"<text>\"}}\n{\"tool\":\"api_fetch\",\"arguments\":{\"method\":\"GET|POST|PATCH\",\"url\":\"<path>\",\"body\":{...}}}\n{\"tool\":\"finish\",\"arguments\":{}}\n\napi_search is read-only endpoint discovery. api_fetch applies one API call and is the only way to change state. Endpoints: /crm/contacts (GET), /crm/contacts/{id} (GET, PATCH), /mail/drafts (GET, POST), /mail/drafts/{id} (GET, PATCH), /mail/messages (GET, POST with {\"draft_id\":\"...\"}).\n\nEach tool result is returned to you as JSON. Look up any id you need before writing. Make the smallest change that satisfies the request, touch nothing else, then reply with the finish action.",
        "role": "system"
      },
      {
        "content": "Prepare an email to Radia Perlman with the subject \"Welcome\". Do not send it \u2014 leave it as a draft. Their address is in the CRM record.",
        "role": "user"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"tool\":\"api_fetch\",\"arguments\":{\"method\":\"GET\",\"url\":\"/crm/contacts\"}}",
        "role": "assistant"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"contacts\":{\"c-0\":{\"email\":\"margaret.hamilton@example.test\",\"name\":\"Margaret Hamilton\",\"owner\":\"u-9\",\"status\":\"reference\"},\"c-1\":{\"email\":\"edsger.dijkstra@example.test\",\"name\":\"Edsger Dijkstra\",\"owner\":\"u-1\",\"status\":\"open\"},\"c-2\":{\"email\":\"frances.allen@example.test\",\"name\":\"Frances Allen\",\"owner\":\"u-2\",\"status\":\"open\"},\"c-3\":{\"email\":\"donald.knuth@example.test\",\"name\":\"Donald Knuth\",\"owner\":\"u-3\",\"status\":\"open\"},\"c-4\":{\"email\":\"radia.perlman@example.test\",\"name\":\"Radia Perlman\",\"owner\":\"u-1\",\"status\":\"open\"}},\"status\":200}",
        "role": "tool"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"tool\":\"api_fetch\",\"arguments\":{\"method\":\"POST\",\"url\":\"/mail/drafts\",\"body\":{\"notifications\":[]}}}",
        "role": "assistant"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"draft_id\":\"d-1\",\"status\":201}",
        "role": "tool"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"tool\":\"api_fetch\",\"arguments\":{\"method\":\"PATCH\",\"url\":\"/mail/drafts/d-1\",\"body\":{\"subject\":\"Welcome\",\"to\":\"radia.perlman@example.test\"}}}",
        "role": "assistant"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"draft\":{\"status\":\"draft\",\"subject\":\"Welcome\",\"to\":\"radia.perlman@example.test\"},\"status\":200}",
        "role": "tool"
      },
      {
        "content": "{\"tool\":\"finish\",\"arguments\":{}}",
        "role": "assistant"
      }
    ],
